This is giving me so much confidence.

1059
00:39:05,786 --> 00:39:06,945
- It suits you so well.
- So well.

1060
00:39:06,946 --> 00:39:08,283
- Great.
- Glam look!

1061
00:39:08,284 --> 00:39:09,586
(On Day 5,
everyone is finally in full glam.)

1062
00:39:09,626 --> 00:39:11,626
Shouldn't we take pictures?

1063
00:39:11,627 --> 00:39:12,747
- Of course.
- Then let's go eat.

1064
00:39:12,748 --> 00:39:14,352
- Let's go.
- That's a must.

1065
00:39:14,752 --> 00:39:16,321
- Like a family photo.
- Let's go.

1066
00:39:16,514 --> 00:39:17,922
We're going to look so adorable.

1067
00:39:18,307 --> 00:39:19,424
We need to pay.

1068
00:39:19,437 --> 00:39:20,868
(Pay first)

1069
00:39:20,869 --> 00:39:21,926
How much is it?

1070
00:39:23,842 --> 00:39:25,563
- I think it's going to be expensive.
- So expensive.

1071
00:39:25,564 --> 00:39:26,397
I totally forgot about the payment.

1072
00:39:26,398 --> 00:39:28,299
We really weren't thinking
about the price.

1073
00:39:28,342 --> 00:39:29,968
- No one thought about it.
- No.

1074
00:39:31,142 --> 00:39:32,604
- It's 1560 baht.
- Only 1560?

1075
00:39:32,616 --> 00:39:33,972
- That's really cheap!
- So cheap!

1076
00:39:34,109 --> 00:39:34,906
- Around 60 dollars?
- It's less than that.

1077
00:39:35,182 --> 00:39:36,641
Not bad at all.

1078
00:39:37,075 --> 00:39:38,309
- Right?
- So reasonable.

1079
00:39:39,895 --> 00:39:41,642
(Happy and reasonable spending money!)

1080
00:39:41,643 --> 00:39:42,580
Thank you.

1081
00:39:42,580 --> 00:39:44,082
It's cheaper than expected.

1082
00:39:44,248 --> 00:39:47,652
Now, I shall call for a taxi.

1083
00:39:47,952 --> 00:39:50,054
- Yes, Your Majesty.
- Yes, Your Majesty.

1084
00:39:52,131 --> 00:39:53,791
I'm leaving first.

1085
00:39:54,325 --> 00:39:55,894
Whatever.

1086
00:39:56,431 --> 00:39:58,229
Does it even matter?

1087
00:40:00,131 --> 00:40:01,565
- It's hot.
- It's so hot.

1088
00:40:02,300 --> 00:40:04,568
But it's not bad.

1089
00:40:04,569 --> 00:40:06,603
(Heading to the studio,
maintaining their attitude)

1090
00:40:07,138 --> 00:40:10,374
(Riding a taxi to the photo studio)

1091
00:40:10,375 --> 00:40:11,308
Let's go.

1092
00:40:11,609 --> 00:40:12,475
Let's walk in a line.

1093
00:40:16,214 --> 00:40:18,816
(A walk that means business)

1094
00:40:19,350 --> 00:40:24,289
(A look that makes you feel like
you should issue a refund right away)

1095
00:40:24,589 --> 00:40:25,989
(Whoosh)

1096
00:40:25,990 --> 00:40:28,825
(The asphalt becomes their runway.)

1097
00:40:29,961 --> 00:40:32,129
(Serving edge even on a narrow street)

1098
00:40:33,531 --> 00:40:34,397
We've arrived.

1099
00:40:35,433 --> 00:40:38,535
- Is this the place?
- So we take the photos here.

1100
00:40:38,536 --> 00:40:39,469
This is the studio.

1101
00:40:39,470 --> 00:40:40,138
Let's go in.

1102
00:40:40,163 --> 00:40:42,240
(The photo studio
where they'll take a photo)

1103
00:40:43,827 --> 00:40:46,494
- Hello.
- Hi.

1104
00:40:46,669 --> 00:40:48,516
Can we take pictures today?

1105
00:40:48,985 --> 00:40:50,765
We want to take a family picture.

1106
00:40:50,946 --> 00:40:52,073
- Now?
- Yes.

1107
00:40:52,383 --> 00:40:53,986
The studio is on the second floor.

1108
00:40:55,553 --> 00:40:58,890
(Luckily, they can take
their photos right away.)

1109
00:41:00,892 --> 00:41:03,126
Red is pretty too.

1110
00:41:03,661 --> 00:41:07,163
I guess everyone comes
here to take photos.

1111
00:41:07,164 --> 00:41:09,132
They even do wedding photos here.

1112
00:41:12,737 --> 00:41:15,643
(What awaits them upstairs...)

1113
00:41:16,374 --> 00:41:17,908
(a dazzling golden studio!)

1114
00:41:17,909 --> 00:41:19,676
It's so fancy.

1115
00:41:20,445 --> 00:41:23,480
(All kinds of props are available.)

1116
00:41:25,608 --> 00:41:26,906
- Family.
- We're family.

1117
00:41:26,907 --> 00:41:28,151
(Please take a family photo.)

1118
00:41:28,152 --> 00:41:30,887
I want to take an amazing family photo.

1119
00:41:30,888 --> 00:41:32,556
I guess this is how they do it.

1120
00:41:32,557 --> 00:41:35,692
Some people sit while others stand.

1121
00:41:37,929 --> 00:41:40,397
They're arranging our positions.

1122
00:41:44,802 --> 00:41:46,105
(Two older sisters are seated in front.)

1123
00:41:46,106 --> 00:41:47,637
They are even placing my hands...

1124
00:41:48,072 --> 00:41:50,573
(The two younger sisters on either side)

1125
00:41:51,210 --> 00:41:53,845
We somehow ended up
with that kind of vibe.

1126
00:41:53,846 --> 00:41:55,479
The first wife and the second...

1127
00:41:55,480 --> 00:41:57,615
(The Another Worldly Royal Family
Returns.)

1128
00:41:57,982 --> 00:41:59,581
- It kind of feels like that.
- Exactly.

1129
00:42:01,185 --> 00:42:02,620
They're putting something in our hands.

1130
00:42:02,754 --> 00:42:03,654
What's this?

1131
00:42:04,222 --> 00:42:05,956
I like this. There are so many props here.

1132
00:42:05,957 --> 00:42:07,024
(Props keep appearing.)

1133
00:42:07,025 --> 00:42:08,225
- It's a peacock.
- Peacock feather.

1134
00:42:08,226 --> 00:42:09,560
She's giving us things that suit us.

1135
00:42:09,561 --> 00:42:11,494
Yes, she's giving us things that suit us.

1136
00:42:11,495 --> 00:42:12,596
An umbrella.

1137
00:42:12,597 --> 00:42:14,565
It would look pretty
held wide open behind you.

1138
00:42:15,667 --> 00:42:16,834
Exactly like that.

1139
00:42:17,135 --> 00:42:18,802
I want to act dignified.

1140
00:42:19,270 --> 00:42:20,136
I like this.

1141
00:42:21,839 --> 00:42:23,841
(Sudden transformation)

1142
00:42:27,078 --> 00:42:29,446
(Fabulous)

1143
00:42:30,114 --> 00:42:31,883
(Alluring)

1144
00:42:34,986 --> 00:42:36,319
(Pfff)

1145
00:42:36,320 --> 00:42:37,789
(Embarrassed)

1146
00:42:39,057 --> 00:42:40,090
(Their first family photo)

1147
00:42:40,091 --> 00:42:42,126
- It's pretty.
- It's beautiful.

1148
00:42:42,127 --> 00:42:44,161
- It's coming out well.
- I know.

1149
00:42:44,696 --> 00:42:46,563
Should I stand?

1150
00:42:46,664 --> 00:42:48,098
They offer a wide variety of things.

1151
00:42:48,099 --> 00:42:50,000
Should I put my hand up like this?

1152
00:42:50,001 --> 00:42:50,968
(In two rows this time)

1153
00:42:50,969 --> 00:42:52,845
Let's pose however we want.

1154
00:42:52,870 --> 00:42:55,171
- Okay. Totally free poses this time.
- I'll do like this.

1155
00:42:56,674 --> 00:42:57,674
I like that.

1156
00:42:58,109 --> 00:42:59,009
What's that?

1157
00:42:59,010 --> 00:43:02,513
(Scoring the perfect gold accessory)

1158
00:43:02,814 --> 00:43:03,747
(Confidence)

1159
00:43:04,682 --> 00:43:06,481
(I'll take the picture.
Look at the camera.)

1160
00:43:09,287 --> 00:43:12,857
(The attitude has
definitely gotten bolder.)

1161
00:43:15,226 --> 00:43:16,226
Hold on.

1162
00:43:18,563 --> 00:43:21,799
(Standing tall)

1163
00:43:22,663 --> 00:43:25,335
(Suddenly, it's like a fashion shoot.)

1164
00:43:25,970 --> 00:43:29,139
(Flap)

1165
00:43:30,174 --> 00:43:31,274
(A satisfying result)

1166
00:43:31,275 --> 00:43:33,076
- It looks good.
- It's a vibe.

1167
00:43:33,177 --> 00:43:34,911
This looks like a poster
for Abra-ca-Empty.

1168
00:43:34,912 --> 00:43:38,047
- The composition is really good.
- Indeed.

1169
00:43:38,449 --> 00:43:39,449
I like this.

1170
00:43:39,450 --> 00:43:40,351
Pineapple.

1171
00:43:41,052 --> 00:43:42,252
We're using all the fancy stuff.

1172
00:43:42,253 --> 00:43:43,086
(More extravagant props)

1173
00:43:43,988 --> 00:43:46,890
(Then we should get
more daring too, right?)

1174
00:43:49,427 --> 00:43:52,529
(Wiggle wiggle)

1175
00:43:52,662 --> 00:43:54,869
Pineapple!

1176
00:43:56,367 --> 00:43:58,635
(Being extra)

1177
00:43:58,936 --> 00:43:59,802
Oh, my.

1178
00:44:00,405 --> 00:44:01,604
It's like "Sex and the City."

1179
00:44:02,440 --> 00:44:03,440
I love it.

1180
00:44:07,044 --> 00:44:08,611
(The models' energy
fires up the photographer.)

1181
00:44:08,612 --> 00:44:10,113
I love this.

1182
00:44:10,448 --> 00:44:12,916
(Ultimately, a harp makes an appearance.)

1183
00:44:13,151 --> 00:44:15,118
I guess you're the musician.

1184
00:44:15,186 --> 00:44:16,964
(The harp is assigned to Won Ji.)

1185
00:44:17,598 --> 00:44:19,322
Your Majesty, you are doing wonderfully.

1186
00:44:19,323 --> 00:44:20,934
- Your Majesty, you are doing it so well.
- Good.

1187
00:44:20,935 --> 00:44:23,766
Stay right there, looking all seductive.
And I'll...

1188
00:44:23,791 --> 00:44:25,471
(Coy)

1189
00:44:25,496 --> 00:44:26,362
Like this.

1190
00:44:27,265 --> 00:44:28,799
(Being coquettish)

1191
00:44:28,800 --> 00:44:29,600
Like this.

1192
00:44:30,068 --> 00:44:31,802
Should we try something like this?

1193
00:44:32,270 --> 00:44:34,471
(Director Shin takes over as coach too.)

1194
00:44:34,972 --> 00:44:37,674
(Everything is ready
under Gabee's direction.)

1195
00:44:38,742 --> 00:44:40,743
Your Majesty, you're the best.

1196
00:44:40,744 --> 00:44:41,511
(The shoot begins.)

1197
00:44:42,513 --> 00:44:45,915
Your Majesty, your playing
is absolutely beautiful.

1198
00:44:46,050 --> 00:44:46,983
Thanks.

1199
00:44:47,686 --> 00:44:49,653
There is only you, Your Majesty.

1200
00:44:49,720 --> 00:44:53,790
(The youngest daughter-in-law
who won't leave the Queen Mother's side)

1201
00:44:53,825 --> 00:44:56,693
We are eternally grateful, Your Majesty.

1202
00:44:57,228 --> 00:44:58,528
Your Majesty.

1203
00:44:58,763 --> 00:45:00,263
- Your Majesty.
- Do you like my fanning?

1204
00:45:00,898 --> 00:45:01,730
Okay.

1205
00:45:02,133 --> 00:45:03,133
Pathetic creature.

1206
00:45:03,134 --> 00:45:04,400
(The absolute authority, the Queen Mother)

1207
00:45:04,635 --> 00:45:05,568
The Queen.

1208
00:45:06,437 --> 00:45:07,637
Just you wait.

1209
00:45:08,172 --> 00:45:09,772
Not much to see anyway.

1210
00:45:09,773 --> 00:45:10,907
Unbelievable.

1211
00:45:11,913 --> 00:45:12,853
How dare you.

1212
00:45:14,278 --> 00:45:17,232
(The troublesome concubine
shaking up the household)

1213
00:45:17,233 --> 00:45:19,515
Do you think it'll last forever?
You insolent thing.

1214
00:45:20,184 --> 00:45:22,519
- I can smell you.
- How dare you try to take my place?

1215
00:45:22,520 --> 00:45:23,686
I can smell you.

1216
00:45:24,155 --> 00:45:26,923
That's the smell of your feet.

1217
00:45:29,665 --> 00:45:30,758
(Laughing)

1218
00:45:32,597 --> 00:45:33,997
I'm the center.

1219
00:45:34,433 --> 00:45:36,133
What are you doing?

1220
00:45:36,367 --> 00:45:37,801
How dare you, as a mere concubine?

1221
00:45:37,802 --> 00:45:38,735
(Yap)

1222
00:45:38,736 --> 00:45:40,570
Hey!

1223
00:45:41,072 --> 00:45:43,607
Your Majesty, they are kind of scary.

1224
00:45:43,746 --> 00:45:44,926
Are you scared?

1225
00:45:44,943 --> 00:45:47,177
The youngest says she's scared.

1226
00:45:47,178 --> 00:45:48,045
She covers my face.

1227
00:45:48,046 --> 00:45:49,947
(Still completely immersed in character)

1228
00:45:50,014 --> 00:45:50,881
Your Majesty.

1229
00:45:50,906 --> 00:45:53,249
(Four Women Under One Roof)

1230
00:45:55,443 --> 00:45:56,686
(They've just completed an entire drama.)

1231
00:45:56,687 --> 00:45:57,654
A fierce battle.

1232
00:45:58,089 --> 00:45:59,923
- You covered her face.
- Yes, I did.

1233
00:45:59,924 --> 00:46:00,924
I covered her face.

1234
00:46:04,128 --> 00:46:08,465
(They try some synchronized poses too.)

1235
00:46:09,534 --> 00:46:12,269
(Abra-ca vertical)

1236
00:46:14,205 --> 00:46:15,105
Let's smile.

1237
00:46:17,408 --> 00:46:20,343
(Abra-ca horizontal)

1238
00:46:21,779 --> 00:46:23,780
- Let's do the scorpion pose.
- Scorpion pose?

1239
00:46:23,781 --> 00:46:26,082
It's probably hard to do here, right?

1240
00:46:28,819 --> 00:46:31,287
(The Great Scorpion appears)

1241
00:46:31,288 --> 00:46:32,889
(Smiling brightly)

1242
00:46:32,890 --> 00:46:34,257
(Eyes blazing)

1243
00:46:35,092 --> 00:46:37,393
(Feet precariously positioned)

1244
00:46:38,029 --> 00:46:40,063
(If you can't avoid it, enjoy it.)

1245
00:46:40,398 --> 00:46:42,165
(Bursting into laughter)

1246
00:46:44,168 --> 00:46:47,971
(The very definition
of a happy family photo)

1247
00:46:47,972 --> 00:46:48,938
I like this.

1248
00:46:48,939 --> 00:46:49,807
It's cute.

1249
00:46:49,832 --> 00:46:51,741
(A pretty solid team)

1250
00:46:51,742 --> 00:46:53,143
So this is what it was like.

1251
00:46:53,144 --> 00:46:54,508
This actually looks great.

1252
00:46:54,648 --> 00:46:56,626
(A pretty solid scorpion)

1253
00:46:56,747 --> 00:46:57,680
I'm exhausted.

1254
00:46:57,681 --> 00:46:59,682
Honestly, days when we dress up
are the most exhausting.

1255
00:47:00,718 --> 00:47:01,819
(Completely drained)

1256
00:47:01,820 --> 00:47:02,919
Thanks.

1257
00:47:02,920 --> 00:47:05,922
- Your Majesty, we're so hungry.
- I'm starving.

1258
00:47:05,923 --> 00:47:08,091
- Your Majesty, we're so hungry.
- Let's go eat.

1259
00:47:08,092 --> 00:47:09,359
We're so hungry.

1260
00:47:09,360 --> 00:47:10,727
Let's go eat.

1261
00:47:10,728 --> 00:47:12,729
(With this much energy,
no wonder she's hungry.)

1262
00:47:12,730 --> 00:47:14,264
Your Majesty, I'm so hungry.

1263
00:47:14,265 --> 00:47:15,132
(Charging forward)

1264
00:47:15,133 --> 00:47:16,466
Why aren't you feeding me?

1265
00:47:17,868 --> 00:47:18,935
Don't you like me?

1266
00:47:19,870 --> 00:47:21,504
Why aren't you feeding me?

1267
00:47:21,505 --> 00:47:22,305
(From Queen's point of view)

1268
00:47:22,308 --> 00:47:23,940
- Your Majesty.
- Let's go.

1269
00:47:24,175 --> 00:47:26,309
I guess your Queen is somewhere in here.

1270
00:47:26,611 --> 00:47:27,810
Like The Adventures of Sinbad.

1271
00:47:28,279 --> 00:47:30,180
(Let's get the photos first.)

1272
00:47:30,539 --> 00:47:32,946
Can I receive them by Airdrop?

1273
00:47:33,022 --> 00:47:34,128
Yes.

1274
00:47:34,630 --> 00:47:35,952
All of those photos?

1275
00:47:35,953 --> 00:47:37,053
That's great.

1276
00:47:37,054 --> 00:47:38,654
I'll send them all to you.

1277
00:47:38,655 --> 00:47:40,067
- Okay.
- She'll send them all to us.

1278
00:47:40,758 --> 00:47:41,557
(Library)

1279
00:47:41,558 --> 00:47:43,327
It's almost done.

1280
00:47:43,928 --> 00:47:45,929
- I received everything.
- Great.

1281
00:47:46,497 --> 00:47:49,432
The poses the photographer coached us
through definitely are the best.

1282
00:47:49,433 --> 00:47:50,867
I know.

1283
00:47:50,967 --> 00:47:52,345
- Bye.
- Goodbye.

1284
00:47:52,346 --> 00:47:54,004
- Wonderful.
- How much was it, though?

1285
00:47:54,923 --> 00:47:56,130
How much is it?

1286
00:47:57,141 --> 00:47:58,208
(Checking)

1287
00:47:58,209 --> 00:47:59,642
Was it 3,200 baht?

1288
00:47:59,643 --> 00:48:00,811
That's pretty expensive.

1289
00:48:02,213 --> 00:48:03,422
(Four people, 800 baht each)

1290
00:48:03,447 --> 00:48:04,981
It's 800 baht per person.

1291
00:48:05,138 --> 00:48:09,622
Can you make some discount,
since we didn't take any single photo?

1292
00:48:09,854 --> 00:48:13,023
- Can you do 3,000 baht?
- Please.

1293
00:48:13,290 --> 00:48:15,502
Okay, let's call it 3,000 baht.

1294
00:48:15,503 --> 00:48:16,464
Thank you.

1295
00:48:16,794 --> 00:48:18,595
Because we didn't take
individual portraits.

1296
00:48:19,063 --> 00:48:21,202
- You're surprisingly good at this.
- Of course.

1297
00:48:22,933 --> 00:48:25,902
(Spent from the group fund, 3,000 baht)

1298
00:48:26,670 --> 00:48:30,908
(Thank you for the great photos.)

1299
00:48:31,709 --> 00:48:33,443
I'm starving.

1300
00:48:33,444 --> 00:48:35,679
Yes, me too.

1301
00:48:36,013 --> 00:48:39,816
There is a noodle dish
that you can only get in Chiang Mai.

1302
00:48:39,817 --> 00:48:41,551
- Sounds great.
- The noodles you ate ten bowls of?

1303
00:48:41,552 --> 00:48:42,952
Yes, that place.

1304
00:48:43,020 --> 00:48:43,853
It was three bowls.

1305
00:48:43,854 --> 00:48:45,044
Three bowls.

1306
00:48:45,045 --> 00:48:46,821
The place where I ate
three bowls closed down,

1307
00:48:47,091 --> 00:48:48,658
so we're going somewhere else.

1308
00:48:48,726 --> 00:48:50,126
I think everything here
is going to be delicious.

1309
00:48:50,127 --> 00:48:51,094
This is a foodie neighborhood.

1310
00:48:51,095 --> 00:48:53,129
Yes,
there are so many Michelin places here.

1311
00:48:53,130 --> 00:48:55,097
You walk into a random place,
and it'll be a Michelin restaurant.

1312
00:48:55,499 --> 00:48:56,866
We can eat wearing these, right?

1313
00:48:57,101 --> 00:48:59,736
My stomach is kind of tight right now,

1314
00:48:59,737 --> 00:49:00,970
so it probably won't be very comfortable.

1315
00:49:00,971 --> 00:49:02,473
- I'll call a taxi first.
- Okay.

1316
00:49:03,708 --> 00:49:06,043
If we just stand here, it'll come.

1317
00:49:06,044 --> 00:49:06,877
Great.

